      "IRI-based" : "AxisMapping",
      "en" : "Axis Mapping"
    },
    "comment" : {
      "en" : "The Axis Mapping is related to an Appearance of an Entity Space\r\n    and defines which Axis of the Entity Space (Source Axis) can be mapped to which Axis of the Reference Space\r\n     (another Entity, Document or Asset Space). This relation can be further specified with an angle and accuracy.\r\n     An AxisMapping object can only relate on Source Axis to one Reference Axis.\r\n     Thus, typically, each Entity Space Appearance links to three Axis Mapping objects."
    },
    "id" : "7"
  }, {
